<Base title="About" description="About Jacob Olson, founder of Olson Geospatial.">
  <h1>About</h1>
  <p>
    I'm Jacob Olson, a GIS professional based in Buena Park, California. I hold an MS in
    Geographic Information Science and a BA in Geography from Cal State Long Beach.
  </p>
  <p>
    I've worked on GIS for utility, transportation, and environmental projects, and programming
    has been a core part of my work throughout, from Python automation to full web applications.
  </p>

  <h2>How I work</h2>
  <p>
    I'm comfortable on both sides of the GIS world. For new projects, I lean toward open-source
    tools because they keep costs down and leave you with full ownership. If your team already
    works in ArcGIS, I'll work inside your environment rather than ask you to change it.
  </p>
</Base>
